        "cooked": "<p>Random Miscellany:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Here's one doc that compares hero powers, and one that looks at villain powers. Anyone who plays Sentinels on a regular basis knows what the different characters can generally do. What I wanted to do was pin down which heroes and which villains can do what, and how often.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I had people introducing new players to the game in mind,&nbsp;where they can look at a page and see which characters make the best tanks, healers, etc. I also commented on certain&nbsp;hero combos:&nbsp;a&nbsp;group of Chrono-Ranger, Expatriette, Parse, and Tachyon need to watch their butts,&nbsp;a group with Haka, Legacy, Ra, The Sentinels, and The Scholar will wonder why the villain killed them with their ongoings, etc.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I also had advanced players in mind who were looking at completing some harder bosses or advanced modes, and wanted to cherry pick heroes who can counter certain villain shenanigans. Here's a Hypersonic Assault for your face, Matriarch! Watch helplessly as I kill all of your birds! Screw you, Devastating Aurora, Visionary is having none of that! Stuff like that.&nbsp;</p><p>I hope you guys find use out of it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Btw, thanks for the sticky!</p>\n<p><a class=\"attachment\" href=\"/uploads/short-url/ps3QIBXJNygbvjc5pM5yJVsZN0I.pdf\">SotM Card Guide – Hero Comparison I.pdf</a> (321 KB)</p>\n<p><a class=\"attachment\" href=\"/uploads/short-url/wci9UWDFQalxhFwVTkczfSld3Zc.pdf\">SotM Card Guide – Hero Comparison II.pdf</a> (356 KB)</p>\n<p><a class=\"attachment\" href=\"/uploads/short-url/1D6IPSEn4SjBduQ9fJBsG3HgiSp.pdf\">SotM Card Guide – Villain Comparison I.pdf</a> (394 KB)</p>\n<p><a class=\"attachment\" href=\"/uploads/short-url/lSyVVWSf4lQhSUdWVxQebAV47VO.pdf\">SotM Card Guide – Villain Comparison II.pdf</a> (346 KB)</p>",
